&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Software Engineer, Rapid Response Assignment - (UK)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Cheltenham, UK (Remote)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VulnCheck&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Exploitation prevention is only as strong as the intelligence driving those efforts, and most of the industry is still running on intelligence that lacks exploit context. VulnCheck, The Exploit Intelligence Company, delivers structured exploit intelligence on what is actively weaponized in the wild, purpose-built for the data lakes, ETL pipelines, automation, and AI and LLM workflows your infrastructure already runs on, raising the capability of everything it powers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Software Engineer, Rapid Response Assignment who combines strong engineering skills with a deep commitment to customer outcomes. In this hands-on role, you&#39;ll make sure our customers stay unblocked and that the issues they raise are resolved quickly, accurately, and for good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll diagnose and fix complex problems across our platform, deliver improvements that directly address customer needs, and work closely with our Customer Success team to turn technical challenges into great outcomes. As part of a global engineering team providing continuous coverage, you&#39;ll bring engineering rigor to the work that customers feel most directly. This is a 100% remote role, but we&#39;re primarily looking for candidates based in Cheltenham, UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve customer-reported issues quickly and thoroughly, from investigation through to a durable fix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose complex, ambiguous problems across our services and data pipelines, tracing them to root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-quality engineering work that improves the platform and directly addresses customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success to align on technical solutions and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve backend systems, APIs, and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, maintainable code and uphold engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system reliability, performance, and observability across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident response and on-call rotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and scaling backend systems as a software engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in one or more languages (Python, Go, Java, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong diagnostic and debugging skills, with a proven ability to root-cause complex production issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and persistence — a drive to understand problems fully and see them through to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-obsessed mindset: you take pride in delivering accurate, high-quality solutions that delight customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with customers and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems, microservices, APIs, system design, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data pipelines, ETL systems, or high-volume data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a customer reliability, sustaining, support, or escalation engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, vulnerability management, or threat intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CVE, NVD, KEV, or exploit intelligence datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming systems or real-time data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth or startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe people do their best work when they feel supported, trusted, and valued. VulnCheck offers benefits designed to meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles, tailored to your country of employment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement/pension plan contributions (e.g., 401k with match in the US; local pension schemes elsewhere)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-friendly environment with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for home office costs (phone &amp;amp; internet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing professional development, coaching, and learning resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for career advancement within a fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Specific benefit details vary by country and are confirmed during the offer process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on over two decades of cybersecurity experience, our team of experts understands the intricacies of vulnerabilities, their exploitation in the wild, and how to leverage this data to build more effective cybersecurity products that produce better outcomes for organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck gives organizations a tactical advantage by providing best-in-class exploit &amp;amp; vulnerability intelligence information. We have a sense of duty to protect the critical infrastructure we rely on including medical devices, power grids and telecommunication networks. We were founded in 2021 in Lexington, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck has a transparent, collaborative, and supportive culture - we are looking for people who have a growth mindset, are curious and innovative. Our team is smart, but humble, hardworking, and supportive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck is proud to be an Equal Employer Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. VulnCheck is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. *Even if your experience doesn’t perfectly align with the job description, we encourage you to apply—we value potential just as much as a perfect resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr. Software Engineer - Cheltenham, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Cheltenham, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time, Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VulnCheck&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploitation prevention is only as strong as the intelligence driving those efforts, and most of the industry is still running on intelligence that lacks exploit context. VulnCheck, The Exploit Intelligence Company, delivers structured exploit intelligence on what is actively weaponized in the wild, purpose-built for the data lakes, ETL pipelines, automation, and AI and LLM workflows your infrastructure already runs on, raising the capability of everything it powers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Software Engineer to design, build, and scale the core systems that power VulnCheck’s vulnerability intelligence platform. This is a high-impact, hands-on role where you’ll own critical services and data pipelines end-to-end—from design through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in shaping architecture, improving system performance and reliability, and delivering features that directly impact customers. While you’ll help resolve production issues, your focus will be on building durable, scalable solutions that prevent them. &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Although this is a 100% remote role, candidates must be located in or around&amp;nbsp;Cheltenham, United Kingdom.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable backend systems, APIs, and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own services end-to-end, including architecture, development, deployment, and operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design discussions and contribute to system architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, maintainable code and drive engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex production issues and implement long-term, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system performance, reliability, and observability across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Data, and other Engineering teams to deliver impactful features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and contribute to a strong engineering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident response and on-call rotations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and scaling backend systems as a software engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, vulnerability management, or threat intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in one or more languages (Python, Go, Java, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing distributed systems and working with microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of APIs, system design, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data pipelines, ETL systems, or high-volume data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to debug and optimize production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset with the ability to lead projects independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CVE, NVD, KEV, or exploit intelligence datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming systems or real-time data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth or startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe people do their best work when they feel supported, trusted, and valued. VulnCheck offers benefits designed to meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote friendly environment with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expense reimbursement for Cell Phone &amp;amp; Internet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing professional development, coaching, and learning resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for career advancement within a fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on over two decades of cybersecurity experience, our team of experts understands the intricacies of vulnerabilities, their exploitation in the wild, and how to leverage this data to build more effective cybersecurity products that produce better outcomes for organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck gives organizations a tactical advantage by providing best-in-class exploit &amp;amp; vulnerability intelligence information. We have a sense of duty to protect the critical infrastructure we rely on including medical devices, power grids and telecommunication networks. We were founded in 2021 in Lexington, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck has a transparent, collaborative, and supportive culture - we are looking for people who have a growth mindset, are curious and innovative. Our team is smart, but humble, hardworking, and supportive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck is proud to be an Equal Employer Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. VulnCheck is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. *Even if your experience doesn’t perfectly align with the job description, we encourage you to apply—we value potential just as much as a perfect resume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;CT Radiographer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Banding:&lt;/strong&gt; Band 6&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Mountain Ash, South Wales&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start: &lt;/strong&gt;ASAP&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Ongoing&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rate:&lt;/strong&gt; £31 - £32 Per Hour &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working hours:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an experienced CT Radiographer with a passion for delivering high-quality patient care? Our client, a leading healthcare provider based in Mountain Ash, South Wales, is seeking a skilled Band 6 CT Radiographer to join their team. This is a fantastic opportunity to work with state-of-the-art equipment in a supportive and dynamic environment. If you are dedicated to advancing your expertise and eager to take on new challenges, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for performing high-quality CT imaging procedures using GE equipment, ensuring patient safety and comfort throughout the process. You will assess and prioritise patient needs, provide clear instructions, and maintain accurate records. Your role will involve collaborating with multidisciplinary teams to deliver comprehensive care, participating in quality assurance activities, and contributing to the training and supervision of junior staff and students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Degree in Diagnostic Radiography or equivalent qualification&lt;br&gt;• Registered with the HCPC&lt;br&gt;• GE experience&lt;br&gt;• Minimum of 2 years post-qualification experience in CT imaging&lt;br&gt;• Proficiency in using GE CT systems&lt;br&gt;• Strong clinical skills in performing and interpreting CT scans&lt;br&gt;• Excellent communication and interpersonal abilities&lt;br&gt;• Ability to work effectively within a multidisciplinary team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Why work with Pulse?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From the moment you register with us, our focus is entirely on you. During our first conversation, you’ll quickly see that we understand your specialty inside and out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our expert recruitment consultants are dedicated to finding you the best opportunities and supporting you every step of the way to secure the perfect placement. With our preferred or sole supplier status with many clients, you’ll have access to exclusive opportunities that you won’t find anywhere else.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We always prioritise your best interests, engaging in meaningful conversations and truly listening to you. You are an individual, a professional—not just a resource.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;How to Apply&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in registering with us, would like to know more about this position or simply discuss any other opportunities we have, we would love to hear from you by applying using the link below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Reasonable Adjustments:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you consider yourself to have a disability or require any reasonable adjustment during the recruitment process or within the workplace, please highlight this at the earliest opportunity by contacting our team. With this information, we will provide appropriate support to you throughout the process and into your work placement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unable to support or accept applications from candidates who are residents within the Red or Amber list of the Code of practice for the international recruitment of health and social care personnel in England, based on the World Health Organisation (WHO) Workforce Support and Safeguard List.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shared services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior AI Specialist, you will drive practical, effective AI adoption across all functions at Genio, empowering commercial, operational, and engineering teams to build and run their own workflows. In this hands-on technical role, you will lead company-wide enablement: training staff to create custom skills and automations, curating a centralized best-practices library, providing first-line technical support, and building custom Python or JavaScript integrations when off-the-shelf software falls short. Working alongside leadership, your success is measured by what the rest of the company can independently build and achieve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement, Coaching &amp;amp; Training: Coach and train employees across all departments to build, test, and maintain their own AI skills and workflows through structured onboarding, hands-on workshops, hackathons, and drop-in support hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills Library &amp;amp; Content Curation: Surface, refine, and document high-performing workflows and prompt patterns from across the company into a centralized library, directly authoring custom solutions to fill operational capability gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Integrations &amp;amp; Automation: Build and maintain API-based integrations, system connectors, and custom scripts using Python or JavaScript when standard platform configurations are insufficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User Support &amp;amp; System Debugging: Provide reliable technical support for AI tooling, investigate connector failures or unexpected model outputs, and incorporate root-cause fixes into ongoing training and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance, Security &amp;amp; Tool Evaluation: Partner with IT, InfoSec, and Compliance to manage access permissions, maintain an up-to-date tool inventory, evaluate third-party software using a buy-over-build approach, and run secure software trials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting directly into the Head of Business Operations (known internally as BizOps) and working most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal Platform Engineer and Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Product Analysts (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT, InfoSec, and GTM Systems Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal stakeholders across all business divisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enablement Mindset &amp;amp; Communication: Motivated by teaching others to build technical solutions, with clear, patient communication skills capable of engaging both non-technical team members and experienced software engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Integration Expertise: Hands-on experience with LLM APIs, agentic tooling, and workflow automation platforms, supported by strong programming skills in Python and/or JavaScript to build custom API integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical AI Experience: Active personal use of AI tools and agents in day-to-day work, backed by concrete examples of built automations, metric tracking, and failure handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debugging &amp;amp; Technical Problem-Solving: Proven ability to investigate, diagnose, and resolve technical faults across both system integrations and AI outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Security &amp;amp; Governance: Practical understanding of security boundaries, access controls, and data privacy requirements when deploying AI agents with system, browser, or file-level permissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pragmatic Curation &amp;amp; Evaluation: Strong judgment in evaluating emerging software based on measurable performance and determining which custom workflows should be standardized company-wide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£70,000 - £80,000 dependent upon experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will discuss ways of working with you at interview however if you have any questions before you apply please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📄 Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think it’s important that you understand how we use and handle your personal information, so here’s a link to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://glean.co/glean-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;privacy notice.&lt;/a&gt; By submitting your application, you’re confirming that you’ve read and understood this notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Fullstack Engineer (Go / Kotlin &amp;amp; React)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Merchant EMEA Engineering builds the technology that helps merchants join, grow, and operate successfully across our markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our organization brings together the strengths of Wolt and Deliveroo and supports merchants across 37 countries. We work across the merchant journey, including onboarding, business growth and support, analytics and recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, and merchant applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams sit close to the business. Rather than primarily building foundational platforms, we build products and features on top of our existing platforms to solve real merchant and market needs, including local business requirements, growth opportunities, and operational challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This open role is based in our tech hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Helsinki&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires being based in Berlin/Helsinki on a hybrid basis. We are currently unable to offer fully remote work, visa sponsorship, or relocation support for this opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Fullstack Engineer, you&#39;ll contribute to products and services used across the merchant experience.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain production software across backend services and user-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on areas such as merchant onboarding, analytics, recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, or merchant-facing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reliable APIs, data models, services, and user-facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, designers, operations, and other engineers to turn business needs into practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features from implementation through production and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design discussions and improve the quality, scalability, observability, and maintainability of our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively as part of your engineering workflow, while critically evaluating their output and taking ownership of the final solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to work outside your primary area of expertise when needed to solve the problem end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers take responsibility for the features and services they work on, from development to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; We work closely across engineering, product, design, data, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism:&lt;/strong&gt; We value simple and maintainable solutions that create business impact without unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We care more about solving the problem than strict frontend or backend boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our backend services primarily use &lt;strong&gt;Go and Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;, while our frontend applications use technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript and React&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also work with technologies including Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, gRPC, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset, with a deep experience in leveraging modern AI tools and solid engineering principles to solve problems end-to-end, independently of any specific technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building production software in backend, frontend, or fullstack environments end-to-end and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in at least one area of the stack, with a willingness to contribute outside that area when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a modern backend language such as Go, Kotlin, Java, or similar, and/or modern frontend technologies such as TypeScript and React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of APIs, databases, testing, and software design fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently on well-scoped problems and collaborate effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a pragmatic, collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; need to be equally strong in frontend and backend. We welcome different balances of experience. You might be primarily a backend engineer who is comfortable making frontend changes when needed, or a frontend-focused engineer who is happy to work with APIs and backend services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What matters most is that you are comfortable working across boundaries to deliver the right solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in one or more of the following areas would be a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Merchant-facing or internal operational tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, recommendations, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grocery, retail, restaurants, logistics, or marketplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrations with external business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or other streaming technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud infrastructure such as AWS, Kubernetes, or Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on products that directly affect how merchants interact with Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash across Europe. The scope is broad and close to the business, giving you the opportunity to work on meaningful problems across different parts of the merchant journey while developing your skills across the stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process here.&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Commercial Manager, Global Supply Chain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Commercial Manager, Global Supply Chain to join our team. This is a global role spanning the DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt ecosystem, with Deliveroo as the hiring entity. This is a hybrid role based in our London office.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll help shape what our global supply chain looks like as DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt increasingly act as one unified company — building a highly efficient commercial approach to how physical goods, logistics, and courier equipment move across our operations worldwide. Rather than three brands running separate playbooks, you&#39;ll help design the single commercial model that brings them together, turning fragmented regional practices into one coherent, scalable supply chain.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to know our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcareers%2Edeliveroo%2Eco%2Euk%2Fthe-finance-team%2F&amp;amp;urlhash=INye&amp;amp;mt=71t6LOLRDB7Y7Pfyn-lkyQFuYJZgxwhcu4Gq__kgb35cdh7EuTjUCZ0KTYw-5LQX4ykuZen4DDkitnzN3rg_rotdLxY&amp;amp;isSdui=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Global Supply Chain team, responsible for getting physical goods—courier apparel, equipment, in-store technology, and consumables—to our riders, merchants, and partners across every market. Sitting underneath the Senior Commercial Manager, you will build and execute sourcing strategies, lead complex international negotiations, and manage supplier performance across the DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sourcing Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate category strategies into actionable sourcing plans&lt;/strong&gt; across warehousing, last-mile fulfilment, apparel, manufacturing, and consumables, driving consolidation across our brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead end-to-end competitive sourcing events&lt;/strong&gt;, utilizing spend analytics, market intelligence, and total cost of ownership (TCO) modeling to secure optimal commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and execute robust negotiation positions&lt;/strong&gt;, focusing on unit cost, freight, duty, quality protections, and working capital impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contract &amp;amp; Supplier Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the end-to-end contracting process&lt;/strong&gt; in partnership with Legal, maintaining a complete contract register and enforcing lifecycle obligations, renewals, and rebates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive day-to-day commercial supplier management&lt;/strong&gt;, conducting structured performance reviews, establishing operational KPIs, and managing Joint Improvement Plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mitigate supply chain risk and ensure continuity of supply&lt;/strong&gt;, establishing dual-sourcing strategies, financial risk assessments, and strict ethical sourcing/modern slavery compliance across manufacturing partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with operational and logistics leadership&lt;/strong&gt; to align requirements, streamline specifications, and build credibility across historically independent regional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essential&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience in supply chain sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven track record delivering measurable commercial value across logistics, 3PL, or manufactured goods categories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ability in end-to-end competitive sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, including hands-on contract negotiation with major international suppliers and manufacturing partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven capability in supplier relationship and performance management&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience handling complex commercial disputes and driving joint innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and financial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;, with expertise in total cost of ownership (TCO) modeling, landed cost structures, and spend analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional stakeholder influence&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to bridge operational needs with commercial outcomes across multi-region or cross-brand environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience sourcing apparel or hardgoods manufacturing, including factory selection, quality control, and ethical audit frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading post-acquisition supplier consolidation or specification harmonisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with direct/inventory-based supply chains, including international freight, customs/duty, and working capital dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;Our GB&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;Power &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;Market &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;practice &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; looking for an experienced Consultant/Senior Consultant to join the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; with a focus on flexibility technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;Our Power Markets practice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;advises&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; generators, investors, developers, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;regulators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; and government bodies &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;operating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; in the GB electricity market. Our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; advice underpins investment decisions worth billions of pounds &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;in capital &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;each year. As part of the market-leading consultancy in this space, recognised for the credibility and bankability of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;insights and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;analysis, you will have a significant and visible impact on the projects you work on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;. You will help clients navigate the GB power landscape by providing market analysis, commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt; and asset valuation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;all &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;power generation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;technologies, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;with a particular focus on battery storage, thermal power generation and long duration energy storage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267152345 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;34&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt; your knowledge of GB wholesale, Balancing Mechanism, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;reserve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt; and response markets to commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;and market &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;due diligence on flexibility investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;. Th&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;ese investments &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;be in assets, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;portfolios&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot;&gt;and businesses with flexibility focus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW143403450 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
