&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Werkstudent/in im Bereich Culinary Operations unterstützt du unser Rezeptentwicklungsteam bei der Pflege und Verwaltung kulinarischer Daten. Dabei arbeitest du eng mit dem Culinary-Operations-Team zusammen und sorgst mit einem guten Blick fürs Detail, Struktur und Sorgfalt dafür, dass Rezepturen korrekt abgebildet und unsere Datensätze zuverlässig gepflegt sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte beachte, dass diese Stelle zunächst auf 12 Monate befristet ist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rezept-Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Pflege und Aktualisierung von Rezeptdaten in unseren internen Systemen sowie kurzfristige Anpassung von Rezepten bei Änderungen von Zutaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Korrekturlesen:&lt;/strong&gt; Prüfung von Rezepten auf korrekte Datenpunkte, Vollständigkeit und Konsistenz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rezept-Optimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Erstellung und Überprüfung anpassbarer Rezeptvarianten auf Basis bestehender Rezepte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datenkontrolle:&lt;/strong&gt; Regelmäßige Validierung der Einträge in unserem System sowie systematische Fehleranalyse und -behebung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance-Analyse: &lt;/strong&gt;Unterstützung bei der Auswertung von Rezepten auf Basis von Kundenfeedback sowie Zusammenfassung neuer Erkenntnisse und wiederkehrender Muster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studium mit Bezug zu Ernährung, Daten, Naturwissenschaften oder Wirtschaft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeisterung für die Themen Essen und Kochen sowie grundlegendes kulinarisches Verständnis (z. B. Garzeiten, Geschmacksprofile, Zutatenkunde), welches eine fachliche Beurteilung bzw. Bearbeitung von Rezepten ermöglicht - auch ohne selbst am Herd zu stehen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailverliebtheit, Zuverlässigkeit und ein selbstständiger Arbeitsstil, kombiniert mit Freude an klaren Strukturen und sorgfältiger Datenpflege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lösungsorientiertes Denken und die Fähigkeit, logisch nachvollziehbare Alternativen selbstständig zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse (jeweils mind. auf C1-Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz &lt;/strong&gt;mit einem tollen Team&amp;nbsp;in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte&lt;/strong&gt; auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen und Convini-Produkte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt; durch interne Trainings sowie ein jährliches Team-Budget für Weiterbildung &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(NICHT FÜR PRAKTIKANTEN)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein flexibles Arbeitsumfeld&lt;/strong&gt; mit Vertrauensarbeitszeit &amp;amp; Work From Home/Work From Abroad Policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; inkl. Buddy-Programm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß&lt;/strong&gt; bei Teamevents, Friday Beers, Company Runs, Buchclub u.v.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote&lt;/strong&gt; bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed, regelmäßige Yoga-Sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt; durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen monatlichen Zuschuss zum Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören. Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1002&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ever imagined saying, “I helped launch the future of transportation”?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rewriting the rules of urban mobility. At Vay, customers tap a button and a car arrives - with no one inside - powered by our world-first Remote Driving technology on real public streets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re live in Las Vegas and scaling fast, powered by a strategic investment of up to $410 million from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.grab.com/sg/&quot;&gt;Grab&lt;/a&gt;. Our mission is simple: replace private car ownership with a faster, cleaner, door-to-door mobility model. If you want to build something real, visible, and genuinely transformative, you’ll feel right at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious to experience Vay yourself? Use the code &lt;em data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;VAYCANDIDATE&lt;/em&gt; for $10 off your first trip in Las Vegas! Download the &quot;Vay&quot; app from the Apple or Google Play store &amp;amp; off you go!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s happening at Vay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First to roll out vehicles in both Europe and the USA on public roads without a human being inside &amp;amp; currently the 2nd largest commercial, driverless car fleet in the Western World.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;ve partnered with &lt;a href=&quot;https://kodiak.ai/&quot;&gt;Kodiak&lt;/a&gt; to bring remote-driving technology to autonomous trucks in the US, showcasing our ability to integrate our system into heavy-duty commercial vehicles and expand the applications of our tech across the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ve completed 10’s of thousands of trips so far and are busy multiplying our Las Vegas fleet just to meet demand!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;...And soon we’ll be expanding across the US &amp;amp; Europe 🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vehicle&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Test Operator&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Berlin and help test the technology behind Vay’s remotely driven vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Testing at Vay happens on real vehicles, across real-world driving environments. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vehicle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Test Operator&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll be among the first people to test new vehicle software and hardware, both through manual driving and remote operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll execute vehicle-level tests, troubleshoot issues using automotive diagnostic tools, collect and analyse test data, and work closely with our engineers to identify and resolve problems before changes are released.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who enjoys working with vehicles and technology, understands how to test systematically, and takes pride in getting the details right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be driving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role where you&#39;ll drive and test our Remote-Driven Car fleet, working through test cases set by our Senior Engineers to check whether our product works as it should.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute vehicle-level testing across software, hardware and driving systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out pre-defined test cases from our engineering team, following clear test scripts and reporting exactly what you find&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flash ECUs and troubleshoot vehicle issues using OBD, CAN traces and other diagnostic tools - whether that&#39;s building on experience you already have, or learning with the support of a remote support engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use CANoe or similar tools to investigate vehicle behaviour, drawing on existing experience or picking it up on the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect test data and provide clear, structured test reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, reproduce and document software and hardware bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that systems perform consistently against defined requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside engineering teams, providing the on-the-ground eyes and data they need to investigate issues and validate fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support both manual and remote vehicle testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This might be a great fit, if you have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 3+ years of hands-on experience in vehicle testing, test operations or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An EU driving licence, a clean driving record and at least 5 years of driving experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence driving safely and responsibly in different testing scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence troubleshooting technical issues and documenting findings clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail across testing, bug reporting and test documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently, prioritise effectively and take ownership of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in remotely driven, autonomous or connected vehicle technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy to work from our offices near Hauptbahnhof and occasionally at Tegel Airport (we test our cars on the runways)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety driver or test driver training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automotive communication protocols and diagnostics, particularly CAN and OBD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CANoe or similar automotive testing and diagnostic tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Jira or other bug-tracking tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical qualification or background in automotive, electronics, mechatronics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-moving engineering or product development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Housekeeping: &lt;/strong&gt;Please only submit your CV in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why choose Vay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪 A global team of smart, motivated people from 30+ countries who love tackling hard problems and turning bold ideas into reality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Huge scope for impact in a fast paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EIP stock options: A stake in Vay’s future - not just a salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Unlimited Paid Vacation Days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎫 Subsidised Deutschland ticket (Berlin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏋️‍♂️ Subsidised Urban Sports Club or FitX Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 All Vay team members receive 30% off their Vay rides&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛍️ Exclusive external discounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 €350 Home Office Set-up&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Relocation financial assistance when relocating to Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Fully funded German Lessons&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎊 Regular team events throughout the year&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;For more information on Vay’s physical demands, working environments and safety requirements, you can review this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1swEohclBwsOgx37G4NHE2szYCA6avS_aQX_WSJ7Ih8k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.6dlrur2mwcd9&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;. We’ll also cover anything specific to this role during the first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We’d love to stay connected for future opportunities, so feel free to include your LinkedIn profile when you apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds and experiences. If you’re excited about shaping something truly groundbreaking, we’d be happy to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;job-modal__content-heading&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;The-team-and-your-Role:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba1876c8-0e3e-48c2-adf7-f7866f5b80f5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Your Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;944&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b78cb1ed-3088-4d3d-a1ea-5c144273a801&quot;&gt;As a part of the larger Engineering department, the Platform team plays a crucial role in enhancing &lt;mark id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;emnify&lt;/mark&gt; competitive edge by improving developer experience to increase development efficiency and scale productivity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d8b983b4-8e59-4c90-9b16-e993879da76a&quot;&gt;You will join a growing team, fostering empathy and a collaboration mindset to ensure continuous improvement of development experience at emnify. The Platform team provides, &lt;mark id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;in addition &lt;/mark&gt;to the centrally managed infrastructure used by all the teams for observability and CI/CD, consultation, SME services, and hands-on support to the engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42f1384d&quot;&gt;As the &lt;mark id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;authority on K8s and CI/CD, you will guide infrastructure engineers in best practices&lt;/mark&gt; for K8s, Jenkins, and GitHub Actions, collaborate with the security team to enhance our cloud infrastructure security, and research and implement new features, tools, and services in the emnify infrastructure and tooling landscape. Your experience and advice will help teams deliver impactful projects successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot; data-local-id=&quot;def5dffc-aeca-4ee4-9551-a0b47b65179a&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu1v1w _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://emnify.github.io/tech-radar/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Emnify technology radar&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Impact:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c3262c78-4888-44ff-b875-2dc06f53b22d&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Impact: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88db3405-f8ec-4c19-86a3-4b2ec897e7fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15729ee9&quot;&gt;You’ll design, implement, and maintain K8s-based solutions, clusters, and supporting AWS infrastructure that help other engineering teams run their applications reliably on Kubernetes. You’ll elevate how we deliver our business-critical applications on Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2241&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f934b7d195ca&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the security team to maintain and increase emnify&#39;s security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2339&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4552cb08-46b6-49ff-8d3a-c1bccf75c828&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;You’ll continuously improve our CI/CD systems and concepts&lt;/mark&gt;, enabling product teams to safely and efficiently deploy their applications on AWS-managed services and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2517&quot; data-local-id=&quot;983215ec-cf77-47b6-884f-914300bf78c9&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with the product teams and take an active part in implementing new infrastructure and services, providing valuable insights and implementation recommendations to ensure the successful and timely delivery of projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c1d2618afd9&quot;&gt;As part of the internal team rotation, take part in supporting the teams in their day-to-day operations and challenges they are facing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
